{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-04-26 16:15:00', 'title': "COMERICA DECLARES DIVIDENDS; ANNOUNCES RESULTS FROM ANNUAL SHAREHOLDERS' MEETING", 'text': 'DALLAS , APRIL 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR COMMON STOCK OF 68 CENTS ($0.68) PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2022.'}